   "like_count": 3,
   "cooked": "<p>The Transparency Working Group promotes transparency, openness and mutual monitoring as a high-level ideal that we’re moving towards at the TEC. The way that we get there is by empowering people to share this experience with the Transparency Audits and making information available to everyone.</p>\n<p>Meetings: Every two weeks on Monday at 3pm CET</p>\n<p>Where? <a href=\"https://discord.gg/PxE8pNAp4q\">Transparency-TEC Discord voice channel</a></p>\n<p>WG Lead: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/iviangita\">@iviangita</a>, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zeptimusq\">@Zeptimusq</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wt8pJvMc5S\">Discussions happen on tec-transparency</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19-YlxdBuivR6qwSTPvlSP6kSLExUDSYT5frp7qaArFI/edit#\">Transparency Manifesto</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jbuqlIXd3s9gRwXbT9ND0zUbE0MaEP9EyO6sHY46iOY/edit\">Agenda</a></p>",
   "action": null,
